---- MODULE Hanoi ----
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets

CONSTANTS D, N

VARIABLES towers

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Helper definitions
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DiskIndices == 0 .. (D - 1)

Disk(d) == 2 ^ d

DiskOn(t, d) == ((t \div Disk(d)) % 2) = 1

IsSmallest(t, d) ==
  /\ DiskOn(t, d)
  /\ (t % Disk(d)) = 0

DestOk(t, d) == (t % Disk(d)) = 0

Total(t) == Sum({ t[i] : i \in 1..N })

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Initial state
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Init ==
  /\ towers \in [1..N -> Nat]
  /\ towers[1] = (2 ^ D) - 1
  /\ \A i \in 1..N : (i # 1) => towers[i] = 0

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Move action
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Move(d, src, dst) ==
  /\ d \in DiskIndices
  /\ src \in 1..N
  /\ dst \in 1..N
  /\ src # dst
  /\ IsSmallest(towers[src], d)
  /\ DestOk(towers[dst], d)
  /\ towers' = [towers EXCEPT
        ![src] = towers[src] - Disk(d),
        ![dst] = towers[dst] + Disk(d)]

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Next-state relation
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Next ==
  \/ \E d \in DiskIndices:
       \E src \in 1..N:
         \E dst \in 1..N:
           Move(d, src, dst)

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Specification
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Spec == Init /\ [] [Next]_<<towers>>

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Invariants
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
TypeOK ==
  /\ towers \in [1..N -> Nat]
  /\ \A i \in 1..N: towers[i] < (2 ^ D)

Inv ==
  Total(towers) = (2 ^ D) - 1

=============================================================================